      "writtenOn": "2018-10-12T20:03:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Agree that we should consider changing the \"Host\" suffix to something more intuitive (in this iteration I copied it from the existing android.hardware.bluetooth.a2dp@1.0 equivalent file.\n\nHowever, \"Sink\" suffix can be confusing on its own - could be mistaken with the A2DP Sink - the Headset.\n\nLets keep thinking about alternative names.",
