    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "7abcbf83_c0383605",
        "filename": "bluetooth/audio/2.0/IBluetoothAudioHost.hal",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 39,
      "author": {
        "id": 1318371
      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-10-12T02:20:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is it possible to pass dataMQ.getDesc() to Stack so the dataMQ is created by HIDL (StreamOut::prepareForWriting) and shared between Stack (Sink) and AudioServer (Provider)?\nAnd, should we add another param about the sessionType so we can know whether AudioHal can handle the offloading or need our help?",
      "revId": "a84de03ab05678e0d716e8f98f50f116c0b8e2e1",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": true
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "413ad674_d6fac666",
        "filename": "bluetooth/audio/2.0/IBluetoothAudioHost.hal",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 39,
      "author": {
        "id": 1071489
      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-10-12T20:03:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "prepareDataPathForWriting() (for the SW data encoding datapath) should be called before startStream() - dataMQ will be generated at that time and should be accessible / shared by both sides:\n\n\u003c--- startSession()\nprepareDataPathForWriting() ---\u003e // NOTE: Used only for the software data encoding datapath\nstartStream ---\u003e\n\u003c--- streamStarted()\n\nAlso, dataMQ is needed / used by only for the software data encoding datapath, hence\nit shouldn\u0027t be used by startStream() - startStream() is used by both SW encoding datapath\nand HW offload datapath.\n\nTo your second question:\nsessionType shouldn\u0027t be necessary here - it will be always the same sessionType when the\nthe session was created by startSession().",
      "parentUuid": "7abcbf83_c0383605",
      "revId": "a84de03ab05678e0d716e8f98f50f116c0b8e2e1",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": true
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "4dfa23f6_3669827f",
        "filename": "bluetooth/audio/2.0/IBluetoothAudioHost.hal",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 39,
      "author": {
        "id": 1121403
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-01-15T00:35:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ack",
      "parentUuid": "413ad674_d6fac666",
      "revId": "a84de03ab05678e0d716e8f98f50f116c0b8e2e1",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
